{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chengguo-e-p061b","title":"曹芳赐诏听孙资还印绶养疾","accounts":[{"id":"chengguo-a-960e18518b0b91dc1041","label":"裴注·《资别传》","text":"曹芳赐诏听孙资还印绶养疾","evidence":["chengguo-q-f11633cc493564bd33a2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0129","role":"赐诏听还印绶赐钱","evidence":["chengguo-q-f11633cc493564bd33a2"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0075","role":"还印绶养疾","evidence":["chengguo-q-f11633cc493564bd33a2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文","precision":"undated","basis":"拆分行动分别核对；无本条直接释年，不承袭复合候选公元年。","evidence":["chengguo-q-f11633cc493564bd33a2"]},"ordering_evidence":"chengguo-q-f11633cc493564bd33a2","source_order":[14,537,68],"order":3226}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0075","name":"孙资","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0129","name":"曹芳","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-f11633cc493564bd33a2","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-b75e254ac7a87dbb1d2e","layer":"pei","quote":"九年二月，乃赐诏曰：‘君掌机密，三十余年；经营庶事，勋著前朝。暨朕统位，动赖良谋。是以曩者增崇宠章，同之三事；外帅群官，内望谠言。属以年耆疾笃，上还印绶；前后郑重，辞旨恳切。天地以大顺成德，君子以善恕成仁。重以职事违夺君志，今听所执。赐钱百万；使兼光禄勋、少府亲策诏：君养疾于第，君其勉进医药，颐神和气，以永无疆之祚；置舍人官骑，加以日秩肴酒之膳焉。’”","attribution":"裴注·《资别传》","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":536,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-176faa9bf9c5c005f7de","start":68,"end":245,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
